{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_title", "source_sha256": "f2b1cd27f4589584e76949418c92003a42e5119cc83c9a76250510a2650c69eb", "ja": "13thLIVE Grand bal masqué 留守電", "zh": "13thLIVE Grand bal masqué 留言电话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7d76d5748cd88b973bc5b6bf33cd9c112806afd27ab07212421eca4d6572a36a", "ja": "13thLIVE DAY2\nGrand bal masquéを無事に終えた\n千鶴からの留守番電話です。", "zh": "13thLIVE DAY2\n顺利结束了Grand bal masqué的\n千鹤打来的电话留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1000_038chz", "source_sha256": "c56bd18f79cdd1cd8aac2c4eeb070240374b0cb9d69f8a1d42d915359e17646c", "ja": "コホン。……あの、{$P$}？\nわたくしです、千鶴ですわ。", "zh": "咳咳。……那个，{$P$}？\n是本小姐，千鹤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "d22bec895aedbc01d444e5cc5772debe9ead4116b7be9d94df5d7120750c3b7a", "ja": "まだ、お忙しい……ですわよね。公演も終わったばかり\nですし。ごめんなさい、つい声が聞きたくなって……", "zh": "您现在……还很忙对吧。毕竟演出也才刚刚\n结束。抱歉，我不知不觉就想听听您的声音了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "62cbe31016d913f1fe3579ffa1f617549a5a5790afcc869fe5dbb3ed8ca3e1a9", "ja": "ではなく！　コホン……わたくしはただ、一刻も早く、\nお礼を言いたかったんですの。……貴方に。", "zh": "不是那样！咳咳……我只是想尽快向您\n道谢。……向您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "43c243af56bdbf3e0b3ecca014d6509c8efa233321b5ec6e36f53f230232a1c2", "ja": "ふふっ、何のことか、お分かりになりまして？\n答えは……これまでのこと、すべてです。", "zh": "呵呵，您明白我指的是什么了吗？\n答案是……至今为止的一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "a2eb60e2fe43f83bd02ae7866b69d29bb79aa79602e6de39a43d59c97e1a7f59", "ja": "二階堂千鶴主演公演。\n『Grand bal masqué』。", "zh": "二阶堂千鹤主演公演。\n《Grand bal masqué》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "b457cd4dbe1c06b70692a2bb73dfcc937f81972cf5b2a37e81b1d5cf3939ef86", "ja": "もうっ、いかにもそれらしいですわよねっ。\nいかにも社交界、いかにもマスカレード……", "zh": "真是的，简直太有那种感觉了！\n一看就是上流社交界，一看就是假面舞会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "e2d0b3c4a89a24e7ad12cbaa3d406129a33b998aedd5d258f28d41613265b43b", "ja": "いかにも……わたくしがずっと憧れていた、\n煌びやかな世界……そのものでしたわ……。", "zh": "简直就是……我一直憧憬的那个，  \n绚丽璀璨的世界……完全是它本身呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "7dd274a108c73c4194d221706447c0ade9a10c1030fb5a5d7863507a6f421b0a", "ja": "{$P$}。\nわたくしを、アイドルにしてくれて。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n谢谢您，让我成为了偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "e3b0144a1026c3723894697ce754415261fbf4ddbc47aa07236da05de6f9a671", "ja": "ここまで連れてきてくれて、本当に……\n本当に、ありがとうございました……！", "zh": "谢谢您带我走到今天，真的……\n真的，非常感谢您……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "36d981220dae87f12220b4f557b4fec41819ca84a251a772b74801d0300be249", "ja": "ぐすっ、べ、別に、泣いていませんのよ？\n少々、目にゴミが入っただけで……。ぐすっ。", "zh": "呜……我、我才没有哭呢？\n只是眼睛里进了点灰尘而已……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "f6cd73e46aa4092de48c680a39e86ec574e2b57f4797f2d24b099c8e0d0566f9", "ja": "そもそも、泣いている場合でもありませんわ。主演\n公演が終わっても、アイドル活動は終わりませんもの。", "zh": "说到底，现在也不是哭的时候。主演\n公演结束了，偶像活动也不会就此结束呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "13bdd92e3eea737f026dd80a7c3b242f0a6044f782c5a2a249cd6b940e35c9f4", "ja": "さあ、また忙しくなりますわよ！\nこれからもしっかり、エスコートしてくださいましね！", "zh": "来吧，接下来又要忙起来了！\n今后也请好好陪同我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "c93a8a95073e95de69d01165345e2aa63f5a1a87d10dbc32d806bb99ab9845dd", "ja": "それでは。もう遅いですし。\n今日はこれで失礼いたします。", "zh": "那么，我先告辞了。已经很晚了。  \n今天就先失陪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_525_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_525_rs_02_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "f18ae85472f2888a8687e25a6b39c56ccfd6c88dde0c1e19389774d334d1e5b8", "ja": "お互い、帰り道は気をつけましょうね。\nそれでは……おやすみなさいませ。", "zh": "回去的路上，我们都要小心哦。\n那么……晚安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
